<title>KENYA: CRICKET-KENYA 148 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KENYA 148 ALL OUT V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya were all out for 148 in 47 overs in their four-nations tournament one-day match against Pakistan on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
